# CtxKeep-generated, committed artifacts must stay LF regardless of a
# contributor's core.autocrlf setting — patchRegion (src/compiler/patchRegion.ts)
# always reads/writes LF, so a CRLF checkout would make untouched regions look
# "changed" the moment any other region gets patched. See DECISIONS.md.
CLAUDE.md text eol=lf
AGENTS.md text eol=lf
.ai/manifest.md text eol=lf
.ctxkeep/config.yaml text eol=lf
